  "prefLabel": "Plc 1504.09 Challenging a Conditional Denial of Initial Licensure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1504.09 Challenging a Conditional Denial of Initial Licensure. An applicant who wishes to challenge the conditional denial of an application for initial licensure shall do so as provided in Plc 304.10.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13621, eff 5-22-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1500.html"
